  DisplayName: Shatterplane
  Description: 'Brittle Stars only - break the plates hanging in the cell. Your guns chip any plate
    from any angle, but square up to a plate and throw your ring, and its flat blast erases
    the whole plate. A few degrees off, it only cuts a stripe. Every crystal is a spare ring
    and floats on the axis of a plate, so taking one lines you up. First team to break the
    target wins.'
